Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Compound instruction set architecture for a neural inference chip involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Tel Aviv, Dr."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 58, "end": 226, "text": "Rachel Katz, a renowned computer scientist, sat in her small office, surrounded by diagrams and schematics of her latest project: a revolutionary neural inference chip."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 227, "end": 455, "text": "The chip, code-named \"Eretz,\" was designed to process vast amounts of data with unprecedented speed and accuracy, making it an ideal solution for the Israeli government's ambitious plans to digitize the country's infrastructure."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 456, "end": 578, "text": "Rachel's team had been working tirelessly to perfect the chip's architecture, and they were on the cusp of a breakthrough."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 579, "end": 730, "text": "The key to their success lay in the innovative compound instruction set architecture, which allowed the chip to learn and adapt at an exponential rate."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 731, "end": 899, "text": "It was this very technology that had caught the attention of the Israeli Ministry of Immigration and Absorption, who saw its potential to streamline the Aliyah process."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 900, "end": 1026, "text": "Aliyah, the mass immigration of Jews from the diaspora to the Land of Israel, was a cornerstone of Israel's national identity."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1027, "end": 1129, "text": "But with the influx of new immigrants came the daunting task of integrating them into Israeli society."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1130, "end": 1268, "text": "The Ministry had been struggling to keep up with the sheer volume of applications, and the bureaucratic red tape was stifling the process."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1269, "end": 1374, "text": "Rachel's chip, with its ability to process vast amounts of data in real-time, was seen as a game-changer."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1375, "end": 1544, "text": "It could quickly and accurately verify the identities of potential immigrants, streamline the application process, and even provide personalized support to new arrivals."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1545, "end": 1662, "text": "The Ministry was eager to deploy the technology, and Rachel's team was working around the clock to meet the deadline."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1663, "end": 1760, "text": "As Rachel poured over the schematics, her mind wandered back to her own family's story of Aliyah."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1761, "end": 1882, "text": "Her grandparents had fled persecution in Eastern Europe, arriving in Israel with little more than a suitcase and a dream."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1883, "end": 2032, "text": "They had built a new life from scratch, and Rachel felt a deep sense of pride and responsibility to contribute to the next chapter of Israel's story."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2033, "end": 2137, "text": "The door to her office burst open, and her colleague, Amir, strode in, a look of excitement on his face."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2138, "end": 2158, "text": "\"Rachel, we did it!\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2159, "end": 2172, "text": "he exclaimed."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2173, "end": 2204, "text": "\"The chip is ready for testing."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2205, "end": 2261, "text": "We can finally show the Ministry what we're capable of.\""}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2262, "end": 2344, "text": "Rachel's eyes lit up as she gazed at the intricate diagrams spread out before her."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2345, "end": 2512, "text": "She knew that this was just the beginning of a new era in Aliyah, one that would be marked by efficiency, innovation, and a deep connection to the land and its people."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 69, "text": "**Compound Instruction Set Architecture for a Neural Inference Chip**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 71, "end": 288, "text": "A compound instruction set architecture (ISA) for a neural inference chip is a novel approach to designing the instruction set architecture of a microprocessor specifically tailored for neural network inference tasks."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 289, "end": 391, "text": "This architecture has been involved in a significant event filing, as evidenced by US patent 11263011."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 392, "end": 406, "text": "**Background**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 408, "end": 584, "text": "Neural networks have become increasingly popular in recent years, with applications in computer vision, natural language processing, and other areas of artificial intelligence."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 585, "end": 757, "text": "However, the computational requirements of these networks can be significant, leading to a need for specialized hardware accelerators to improve performance and efficiency."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 758, "end": 910, "text": "Neural inference chips are designed to accelerate the inference phase of neural networks, where the network is deployed to make predictions on new data."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 911, "end": 952, "text": "**Compound Instruction Set Architecture**"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 954, "end": 1167, "text": "A compound ISA for a neural inference chip is an instruction set architecture that combines multiple instructions into a single instruction, allowing for more efficient execution of neural network inference tasks."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1168, "end": 1322, "text": "This approach can improve performance by reducing the number of instructions that need to be executed, reducing memory access, and increasing parallelism."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1323, "end": 1345, "text": "**US Patent 11263011**"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1347, "end": 1523, "text": "On February 21, 2022, the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) granted patent 11263011, titled \"Compound Instruction Set Architecture for a Neural Inference Chip.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1524, "end": 1704, "text": "This patent describes a novel compound ISA for a neural inference chip, which includes a set of instructions that can be combined to perform complex neural network inference tasks."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1705, "end": 1807, "text": "The patent application was filed on August 14, 2020, and was assigned to a leading technology company."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1808, "end": 1913, "text": "The inventors listed on the patent are experts in the field of computer architecture and neural networks."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1914, "end": 1930, "text": "**Significance**"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1932, "end": 2068, "text": "The compound ISA for a neural inference chip has significant implications for the field of artificial intelligence and machine learning."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2069, "end": 2327, "text": "By improving the performance and efficiency of neural network inference tasks, this architecture can enable faster and more accurate predictions, leading to breakthroughs in areas such as computer vision, natural language processing, and autonomous vehicles."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2328, "end": 2342, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2344, "end": 2461, "text": "* US Patent 11263011, \"Compound Instruction Set Architecture for a Neural Inference Chip,\" granted February 21, 2022."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2462, "end": 2521, "text": "* \"Neural Network Inference on Specialized Hardware,\" by J."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2522, "end": 2654, "text": "Wang et al., published in the Proceedings of the 2020 ACM\\/IEEE 47th Annual International Symposium on Computer Architecture (ISCA)."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Aliyah", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Aliyah", "scope": "Israeli government's immigration process", "claim": "The compound instruction set architecture for the neural inference chip was involved in the Aliyah process, which is the mass immigration of Jews from the diaspora to the Land of Israel.", "answer": "Aliyah", "quote": "It was this very technology that had caught the attention of the Israeli Ministry of Immigration and Absorption, who saw its potential to streamline the Aliyah process. Aliyah, the mass immigration of Jews from the diaspora to the Land of Israel, was a cornerstone of Israel's national identity. But with the influx of new immigrants came the daunting task of integrating them into Israeli society. The Ministry had been struggling to keep up with the sheer volume of applications, and the bureaucratic red tape was stifling the process. Rachel's chip, with its ability to process vast amounts of data in real-time, was seen as a game-changer. It could quickly and accurately verify the identities of potential immigrants, streamline the application process, and even provide personalized support to new arrivals.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Aliyah", "filing of US patent 11263011"]}
